  "description": "<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"59\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"57\">Migatronic Focus Stick 161 E PFC | Gebruikt | €349,99</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"61\" data-end=\"412\">De <strong data-start=\"64\" data-end=\"100\">Migatronic Focus Stick 161 E PFC</strong> is een professionele <strong data-start=\"122\" data-end=\"147\">elektrode lasapparaat</strong> geschikt voor MIG/MAG en elektrode-lassen. Dit compacte en gebruiksvriendelijke apparaat is ideaal voor zowel de hobbyist als de professional die precisie en betrouwbaarheid vereist. Dit exemplaar is <strong data-start=\"348\" data-end=\"389\">gebruikte maar volledig geteste staat</strong> en direct inzetbaar.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"414\" data-end=\"433\"><strong data-start=\"414\" data-end=\"431\">Specificaties</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"765\">\r\n<li data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"454\">\r\n<p data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"454\">Merk: Migatronic</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"455\" data-end=\"487\">\r\n<p data-start=\"457\" data-end=\"487\">Model: Focus Stick 161 E PFC</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"525\">\r\n<p data-start=\"490\" data-end=\"525\">Type: Elektrode lasapparaat / MMA</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"526\" data-end=\"598\">\r\n<p data-start=\"528\" data-end=\"598\">Toepassing: Elektrode lassen, MIG/MAG lassen (indien van toepassing)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"599\" data-end=\"637\">\r\n<p data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"637\">Vermogen: [Invullen indien bekend]</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"684\">\r\n<p data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"684\">Max. lasstroom: [Invullen indien bekend] A</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"725\">\r\n<p data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"725\">Gewicht: [Invullen indien bekend] kg</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"765\">\r\n<p data-start=\"728\" data-end=\"765\">Toestand: Gebruikt, volledig getest</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"784\"><strong data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"782\">Meegeleverd</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"909\">\r\n<li data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"821\">\r\n<p data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"821\">Migatronic Focus Stick 161 E PFC</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"872\">\r\n<p data-start=\"824\" data-end=\"872\">Kabels en accessoires zoals standaard geleverd</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"909\">\r\n<p data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"909\">Machine in nette, werkende staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"926\"><strong data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"924\">Voordelen</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"1125\">\r\n<li data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"957\">\r\n<p data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"957\">Compact en robuust ontwerp</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"1005\">\r\n<p data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"1005\">Geschikt voor professioneel en hobbygebruik</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1053\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1053\">Eenvoudig in gebruik met stabiele lasstroom</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1097\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1097\">Volledig getest en direct gebruiksklaar</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1125\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1125\">Duurzaam en betrouwbaar</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1148\"><strong data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1136\">Prijs</strong><br data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1139\">€349,99</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1284\"><strong data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1174\">Ophalen of verzenden</strong><br data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1177\">Afhalen bij <strong data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1218\">Used Products Spijkenisse</strong>. Verzending mogelijk; het lasapparaat wordt zorgvuldig verpakt.</p>",
